"4rem\"},\"px\":{\"base\":\"1.5rem\",\"md\":\"3.75rem\",\"lg\":\"10.75rem\",\"xl\":\"17.75rem\"},\"centerContent\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"mb\":{\"base\":\"1.5rem\",\"md\":\"2.8125rem\"},\"width\":\"full\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"borderRadius\":{\"base\":\"a.border.radius.md\",\"md\":\"a.border.radius.lg\"},\"src\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/7IavVKfcSHiiyduvqfMqgV/da9f0f0bc0ff02090c8174ca8fa9d92d/engine_room.jpg?fm=webp\",\"alt\":\"Engine room onbaord ship\",\"ratio\":\"article\",\"fit\":\"cover\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"gap\":\"1.5rem\",\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"px\":{\"base\":0,\"md\":\"3.125rem\",\"lg\":\"5.3125rem\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"article\":{\"sys\":{\"firstPublishedAt\":\"2025-12-15T08:00:19.006Z\",\"id\":\"1eIWMjKtYqs6vWgwuJlDgO\"},\"__typename\":\"InsightArticles\",\"title\":\"Beware of backflush filter failures – a cause of engine damage\",\"slug\":\"beware-of-backflush-filter-failures-a-cause-of-engine-damage\",\"summary\":\"Automatic backflush filters are designed to protect engines by keeping fuel and lubricating oil clean. However, Gard’s recent claims experience shows that when these filters fail, they can become a serious source of engine damage, with potentially costly and time-consuming consequences.\",\"disclaimer\":\"The information provided in this article is intended for general information only. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information at the time of publication, no warranty or representation is made regarding its completeness or timeliness. The content in this article does not constitute professional advice, and any reliance on such information is strictly at your own risk. Gard AS, including its affiliated companies, agents and employees, shall not be held liable for any loss, expense, or damage of any kind whatsoever arising from reliance on the information provided, irrespective of whether it is sourced from Gard AS, its shareholders, correspondents, or other contributors.\",\"publishedAt\":null,\"updatedAt\":null,\"topicCollection\":{\"items\":[{\"topicName\":\"Vessel\",\"slug\":\"vessel\",\"linkedFrom\":{\"articleTopicNewMigrationDevCollection\":{\"items\":[]}}}]},\"pdfArticle\":{\"url\":\"https://assets.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/3gEcSSSzsuXYY4tyOs2KPA/3010c3bf4b4d101370f97a6048e9b0fc/1eIWMjKtYqs6vWgwuJlDgO_en-US.pdf\"},\"body\":{\"json\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Automatic backflush filters for fuel and lubricating oil cleaning have been in operation for many years and have become common in many engine installations. The filters generally consist of one or more chambers with a set of candles of fine wire mesh that the oil flows through. Larger particles get stuck on the surface while smaller particles flow through the filters and back into circulation. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"The difference compared to traditional filtration is the backflush sequence, which is normally pressure triggered, dependent on make and type of your installation. When the differential pressure reaches a set value the filter compartment closes and the oil flow stops. Simultaneously, a new chamber opens to allow continuous filtration and engine operation. Air is then forced through the closed chamber, rinsing the candles before the chamber is then refilled with clean oil and set in standby for further operation (as illustrated by the graphics below). \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"subscript\"}],\"value\":\"Source Boll \u0026 Kirch Filterbau GmbH.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"At Gard, we have seen several claims where this fine filter mesh has disintegrated in use, resulting in pieces of the wire mesh entering the lube oil system and severely damaging engine bearings.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Differential pressure concerns \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Pressure-triggered rinsing cycles are an inherent risk. If the filter candle mesh start disintegrating, the mesh becomes riddled with holes. With enough ruptures, the differential pressure drops, as the oil will follow the easiest route through the mesh. This will lead to a free flow through the housing, with oil potentially carrying wire mesh parts directly into the engine. From the cases seen there have been no warning of this prior to engine taking damage. Depending on the make and type of your installation if there are no counter on the rinsing cycles performed an abnormally reduced differential pressure is perhaps your only warning. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"The damages \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"The small wires of the mesh break off and can travel through the entire lubrication system, causing severe damage. This damage will be primarily located on bearing surfaces on camshafts and crankshafts. This will in turn create severe surface deterioration and breakdown that can damage the engine even further and lead to dangerous situations . Replacement of main bearings and even the crankshaft itself can be very expensive and time consuming. In one Gard case, replacement of a crankshaft is expected to cost 2.2 million USD with a 8-12 week period just to source the new equipment.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"subscript\"}],\"value\":\"Bearing with severe damages from debris.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Where deterioration of the mesh is found, mechanical and chemical cleaning of the entire system affected will be required prior to operation. If the cleaning process is substandard, new damages may arise swiftly after repairs have taken place. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"How to avoid serious incidents\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Depending on the make and type of your filters, maintenance requirements will differ. In the matters seen by Gard, disintegration is either due to mechanical damages from rough handling by the crew or old candles having suffered excessive rinsing cycles and use beyond the expected lifetime. The lifetime is determined by shelf-life storage conditions, rinsing cycles and handling. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"During the rinsing cycle, the pressurized air from the common air system flows through the candles, forcing away debris and sediments. This exerts outward pressure on the candles mesh wall which during normal operation is subject to inward pressure. The candle can tolerate a finite number of cycles before deterioration occurs. As these systems in general are designed as autonomous systems, cycle tolerance will vary depending on oil type and fouling. Monitoring consistency in rinsing cycles is a key indicator for filter operation. Gentle handling of the candles when manual cleaning is performed is vital to ensure reliable operation. Rough manual handling or high-pressure air cleaning may cause damage. Using proper cleaning tools onboard, such as an ultrasonic cleaner unit or cleaning gun which blows horizontally, is recommended.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Candles should be carefully inspected after cleaning. Damage can often be very small and for the untrained eye might not be considered alarming or noteworthy and may not be reported before the filters are set back to service. Besides proper cleaning, how the spare candles are stored is vital for safe usage. If the candles are stored in a clean environment shielded from physical damage they may last for years and still be ready for safe use. If the candles are roughly treated and stored in places where they are subject to damage, it should be carefully considered whether they remain fit for use.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Considering the numerous candles within a filter assembly, error during installation can also contribute to damage and loss of filter function.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"When assembling the filter candles, it is important that the \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"value\":\"locating plate \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"is correctly mounted and that all filter candles are located within the recesses on the locating plate before mounting the top plate. Special attention should be paid to the candles in the inner circumference. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Gard Recommendations:\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"To maintain backflush filters and prevent damage due to deterioration: \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Ensure the correct manual and procedures for the actual filter system installed are available onboard the vessel and that the crew have been adequately familiarised and trained.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"To ensure safe operation of the backflush filters, procedures on manual handling addeherent to makers reccomendations should be in place, together with clear procedures on when filters are to be taken out of use due to damage and risk of failure. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"The engine crew should be trained to spot even minor damage to the candles. Training on how to handle the filters with care during cleaning is vital. We recommend having cleaning tools onboard like an ultrasonic cleaner unit or cleaning gun which blows horizontally onboard,\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"If not already installed, a strainer or in-line filter should be installed after the backflush filter to ensure debris from candle disintegration is captured before it contaminates the oil system. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Use OEM parts. If in doubt, contact your filter manufacturer for advice. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"subscript\"}],\"value\":\"Filter mesh started to disintegrate.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"subscript\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"value\":\"Filter wire damage to main bearing.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"links\":{\"entries\":{\"block\":[],\"hyperlink\":[]},\"assets\":{\"hyperlink\":[],\"block\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA/86f21335932a283faa4905b9de1e74ab/Engine_1.png\",\"title\":\"Engine 1\",\"description\":\"Source Boll \u0026 Kirch Filterbau GmbH\"},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA/537a588bc9a9a3bd9ea76cd4de3c2412/Engine2.png\",\"title\":\"Engine2\",\"description\":null},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5/71dfedfdc796ddaed3a4ed588784e10a/Engine_3.png\",\"title\":\"Engine 3\",\"description\":null},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3/488214b55fb36fbb6634c609a9a4ec95/Engine4.png\",\"title\":\"Engine4\",\"description\":\"\"}]}}},\"mainImage\":{\"altText\":\"Engine room onbaord ship\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/7IavVKfcSHiiyduvqfMqgV/da9f0f0bc0ff02090c8174ca8fa9d92d/engine_room.jpg\"}},\"authorCollection\":{\"items\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"3KIXBxK4TiZFrvgbZE921A\"},\"name\":\"Kenneth Fjeldstad\",\"title\":\"Claims Executive\",\"office\":{\"name\":\"Bergen\"},\"profilePicture\":{\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/1OSLeyfg1cRj6OodGZFCHA/7df533b9872ee08cc4f608be666cffec/Kenneth_Fjeldstad.jpg\"}}]}},\"articleJap\":{\"title\":\"機関損傷の原因となる逆洗フィルターの破損にご注意を\",\"summary\":\"自動逆洗フィルターは、燃料油や潤滑油をクリーンな状態に保ち、機関を保護するための装置です。しかし、最近のクレーム対応の経験から、こうしたフィルターは破損すると機関損傷の大きな原因となり、修理に多大な費用と時間を要するおそれがあることが判明しています。\",\"pdfArticle\":{\"url\":\"https://assets.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/3gEcSSSzsuXYY4tyOs2KPA/34ae12730f7fe84d568dd2843f42bcfe/1eIWMjKtYqs6vWgwuJlDgO_ja-JP.pdf\"},\"body\":{\"json\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"燃料油や潤滑油の浄化を目的とした自動逆洗フィルターは長年使用されており、今では多くの機関設備に普及しています。装置は1つ以上のチャンバーで構成されているのが一般的です。中にファインワイヤーメッシュ製の円筒型（キャンドル）フィルター一式が収められており、そのフィルターを油が通過する際、大きい粒子はフィルター表面で捕捉され、小さい粒子はそのまま通過して再び機関内に送られます。\\n\\n従来のろ過と比べて異なるのは逆洗工程です。装置のメーカーや型式にもよりますが、差圧作動式が一般的です。差圧が設定値に達すると、ろ過室が閉じて油の流入が止まり、それと同時に、ろ過と機関稼働を継続できるよう別のチャンバーが開きます。そして閉鎖されたチャンバーに空気が押し込まれ、キャンドルが洗浄されると、きれいな油が再充填されて引き続き使用できる状態になる仕組みです（下図参照）。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"出典：Boll \u0026 Kirch Filterbau GmbH\\n\\nしかし、このファインフィルターメッシュが使用中に破断し、その破片が潤滑油システムの中に入って機関の軸受に激しい損傷を与える事故が複数発生しています。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"差圧に関する問題\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"差圧作動式の洗浄サイクルにはリスクがつきものです。キャンドルのフィルターメッシュが破断し始めるとメッシュは多数の穴が開いた状態になります。そのまま破断が進行すると、油は抵抗の最も小さい経路を通過するため差圧が低下します。その結果、ハウジング内で油が自由流動状態となり、ワイヤーメッシュの破片が油と共に機関内部に直接流入するおそれがあるのです。実際にあった事故では、機関が損傷する前にこのような兆候は一切見られませんでした。装置のメーカーや型式にもよりますが、洗浄サイクルの実行回数を記録するカウンターが装備されていない場合は、差圧の異常低下が損傷を予測するための唯一の兆候となるでしょう。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"損傷\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"ワイヤーメッシュは破断すると、その破片が潤滑油システムを通り抜けて深刻な損傷を引き起こすおそれがあります。この損傷が主に発生するのは、カム軸やクランク軸の軸受表面です。傷が付くことで、表面が激しく劣化・破損して機関がさらに損傷し、危険な状況につながりかねません。主軸受、さらにはクランク軸自体を交換するとなると、非常に多額の費用がかかり、時間も要するでしょう。実際のある対応事例では、クランク軸の交換費用に220万ドルを要し、調達するだけでも8～12週間かかると見込まれています。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"value\":\"破片で激しく損傷した軸受\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"メッシュの劣化が見つかった場合は、作動させる前に、問題が生じている装置全体を機械や薬品を使ってクリーニングすることが必要です。この時のクリーニング方法が基準を満たしていないと、修理を行ってもすぐに別の損傷が生じるおそれがあります。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"重大事故を避けるための方法\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"$23\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"推奨事項：\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-2\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"逆洗フィルターの状態を良好に保ち、劣化による損傷を防ぐために、以下の点を推奨します。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"現在設置されているフィルター装置の正しいマニュアルと手順書を船上に用意し、乗組員がその内容を熟知して十分な訓練を受けた状態にしておきましょう。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"安全に運用できるよう、人の手で取り扱う際の手順をメーカーの推奨事項に基づいて定めましょう。また、損傷した場合や故障の危険がある場合にどの時点で使用を中止して取り外すべきか、手順を明確にしておきましょう。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"キャンドルの軽微な損傷も発見できるよう、機関部の乗組員に訓練を施しておきましょう。クリーニング時の慎重な取り扱い方法を練習しておくことが極めて重要です。超音波クリーナーや水平に吹き出すクリーニングガンなど、船上にある適切なクリーニングツールを使用するようにしてください。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"キャンドルのメッシュが破断して生じた破片を油システムへの混入前にキャッチできるよう、ストレーナーやインラインフィルターがまだ設置されていなければ、逆洗フィルターの後ろに設置しておきましょう。\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"OEM部品を使用しましょう。ご不明な点がある場合は、フィルターのメーカーにご確認ください。 \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"value\":\"破断し始めたフィルターメッシュ\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"value\":\"フィルターのワイヤーで損傷した主軸受\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"links\":{\"entries\":{\"block\":[]},\"assets\":{\"hyperlink\":[],\"block\":[{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/7pYzr9KgCRq24dFdZkAFJA/a06b4b74d0f9bd65c35f191cf025deff/Engine_1.png\",\"title\":\"Engine 1 JP\",\"description\":null},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/3kOzxL7lYXaHDrpOfD0NlA/f160809326d95543eeeacc576fd8b3d3/Engine2.png\",\"title\":\"Engine2 JP\",\"description\":null},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/1KMqHDH7XFLZ4jbZhzLmt5/79600f718bce9d83a4919c5260913793/Engine_3.png\",\"title\":\"Engine 3 JP\",\"description\":null},{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3\"},\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"url\":\"https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/jchk06tdml2i/5WbyDc4YDj3vL7Ejem1bP3/ba859fb63befe416d214a13ec958a47a/Engine4.png\",\"title\":\"Engine4 JP\",\"description\":null}]}}}},\"articleSimpChin\":{\"body\":null,\"pdfArticle\":null,\"title\":null,\"summary\":null},\"articleTradChin\":{\"body\":null,\"pdfArticle\":null,\"title\":null,\"summary\":null},\"variant\":\"language-tabs\"}],\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\"]}]]}]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"maxW\":\"container.3xl\",\"px\":0,\"pt\":0,\"pb\":0,\"bg\":\"a.brown.100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"maxW\":\"container.2xl\",\"px\":{\"base\":\"1.5rem\",\"md\":\"3.75rem\"},\"pt\":{\"base\":\"4rem\",\"md\":\"4rem\"},\"pb\":{\"base\":\"4rem\",\"md\":\"4rem\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"maxW\":\"container.2xl\",\"px\":\"0\",\"mx\":\"0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"as\